msgid "Here are listed $COUNT desktop applications NOT in AppImage format. Launchers and icons are downloaded separately during the installation process (through <a href=\"https://github.com/ivan-hc/AM\">AM</a> and <a href=\"https://github.com/ivan-hc/AppMan\">AppMan</a>). Most of them already have all the necessary requirements to be easily exported into AppImage packages... or they are waiting to be moved to another category (see <a href=\"appimage-on-the-fly.html\">AppImages on-the-fly</a>)"
msgstr ""

#: pla-site.toml:[cat_comments.metapackages]
msgctxt "metapackages"
msgid "Here are listed $SUITE_COUNT \"metapackages\" (along with their $ITEM_COUNT items), those few scripts that allow the use of many more programs with one installation. Find which metapackage corresponds to the program you're interested in from this list"
msgstr ""

